                  "text": "14.19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " kamakhabi kataru Barumi bakhupa: ne lulala napwa kamabaale. Nesiikha mu nyanja ne meeli kamakhabi kataru ne lulala nekhala mumeechi chisa kamakhumi kabili na chine. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.11.25",
